    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to \"rebuild\" anything. that sounds exhausting. what’s the point of trying to find a new group or \"navigating\" this when everyone knows what happened? it just feels like the version of me that actually mattered is gone. everything is just empty now.",
